<title>JAPAN: Japan Nov domestic vehicle output up 8.2% yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Nov domestic vehicle output up 8.2% yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's domestic vehicle production in November rose 8.2 percent from a year earlier to 932,241 vehicles, the Japan Automobile Manufacturers' Association (JAMA) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It was the third successive month in which output rose on a year-on-year basis.</p>
<p>The following is a breakdown of the figures with percentage changes:</p>
<p>					 NOV		 YR/YR PCT</p>
<p> Cars				719,641		+10.2</p>
<p> Trucks			    208,770		 +2.3</p>
<p> Buses				 3,830		-11.9</p>
<p> TOTAL			     932,241		 +8.2</p>
<p>October production by major manufacturers:</p>
<p>			    NOV		 YR/YR PCT</p>
<p> Toyota Motor	 325,021		+17.3</p>
<p> Nissan Motor	 137,558		 -4.1</p>
<p> Mitsubishi Motors   96,398		 -9.6</p>
<p> Honda Motor	  102,441		+29.2</p>
<p> Mazda Motor	   67,600		 +2.8</p>
</text>
